<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: archotech ratkin tail -->
  <RK_Hediff_ArchotechTail.label>超凡仿生尾巴</RK_Hediff_ArchotechTail.label>
  <!-- EN: An installed archotech ratkin tail. It senses posture and micro-movements to keep the bearer perfectly balanced, feels like living flesh, and is harder to damage than plasteel. If harmed, it repairs itself over time. Its inner workings are a mystery. -->
  <RK_Hediff_ArchotechTail.description>一条已安装的超凡仿生尾巴。它可以感知到安装者的姿势和细微动作，从而使其身体平衡性达到完美状态。它看上去和生物原本的肢体几乎无异，但却比玻璃钢更坚固。即使它受到伤害，也会随着时间的推移自我修复。它的内部结构对于所有人来说都是个谜。</RK_Hediff_ArchotechTail.description>
  <!-- EN: an archotech ratkin tail -->
  <RK_Hediff_ArchotechTail.labelNoun>超凡仿生尾巴</RK_Hediff_ArchotechTail.labelNoun>

  <!-- EN: bionic tail -->
  <RK_Hediff_BionicTail.label>仿生尾巴</RK_Hediff_BionicTail.label>
  <!-- EN: An advanced artificial tail. It also has a small AI that automatically balances the user's missing. -->
  <RK_Hediff_BionicTail.description>一条已安装的仿生尾巴。它内置的小型AI可以帮助安装者自动调解平衡性。</RK_Hediff_BionicTail.description>
  <!-- EN: a bionic tail -->
  <RK_Hediff_BionicTail.labelNoun>仿生尾巴</RK_Hediff_BionicTail.labelNoun>
  
